## Case: int-bool-text-key-identity
id: "av.parity.1084.int-bool-text-key-identity"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1084"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn main() int {
    var values = { 1: 11, true: 20, "1": 1, -7: 2 }
    var k = 1
    values[k] = 19
    if values[true] != 20 || values["1"] != 1 { return 0 }
    return values[k] + values.true + values["1"] + values[-7]
}
```

